  "description": "This skill deploys frontend and full-stack projects to EdgeOne Makers (Tencent EdgeOne). Trigger this skill whenever deployment is part of the task — whether as the primary intent or a secondary step. Examples: \"deploy my app\", \"publish this site\", \"push this live\", \"create a preview deployment\", \"deploy to EdgeOne\", \"ship to production\", \"go live\", \"release\", \"publish a new version\", \"redeploy\", \"上线\", \"发布\", \"发一版\", \"重新部署\", \"搭建并部署\", \"开发并上线\", \"build and deploy\", \"create and deploy\". ⚠️ Also trigger when any agent is about to execute `edgeone makers deploy` or `edgeone makers deploy` commands — the skill contains critical rules for parsing deploy output and presenting access URLs. Do NOT trigger for post-deployment runtime errors (e.g. CORS issues, 500 errors after deploy — use edgeone-makers-dev for troubleshooting).",
